      "cooked": "<p>This is based off the prompt for a Mr Jitters story.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/0/001bfed578232d097909fe8839aacdae54bef8e4.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/001bfed578232d097909fe8839aacdae54bef8e4\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/001bfed578232d097909fe8839aacdae54bef8e4_2_322x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"XYKYOI1ltA1ov5I1yCFTLUhgM\" width=\"322\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/001bfed578232d097909fe8839aacdae54bef8e4_2_322x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/001bfed578232d097909fe8839aacdae54bef8e4_2_483x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/001bfed578232d097909fe8839aacdae54bef8e4_2_644x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/001bfed578232d097909fe8839aacdae54bef8e4_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×2977 758 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-194-americas-finest-legacy-214\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-194-americas-finest-legacy-214\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/2/2195fb0b2700b1df502aa120a68af896730a6609.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-194-americas-finest-legacy-214\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Letters Page: Episode #194 - America's Finest Legacy #214</a></h3>\n\n  <p>It's SCARY how well this episode went! Even though we recorded it much later than we usually do! And look at how cool this cover turned out!  Show Notes: Run Time: 1:36:39 After some goofs and talking about Trevor, we get into the overview, in which...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
