      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2021-11-09T17:30:42.850Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was very confused by the show notes, like, why is someone covering a piece Jean-Marc wrote? That’s awesome? And then I remembered how to read.</p>\n<p>Mr. Jitters is so weird. He seems like such a goofy, gimmicky character, but he’s a serious-pants villain!</p>\n<p>Why do I feel like the NERO is something that could eventually gain sentience, create a robot body for itself, and then wreak havoc across Megalopolis? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=10\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>That conversation about arachnophobia was great. I’ve always identified with Adam on that level, though I, too, have become less afraid of spiders as I’ve gotten older. I’ve decided jumpers are actually okay, for one, so I’ve got that over on him!</p>\n<p>Love that AU Wraith story. And remember, it could <em>totally</em> become canon if enough people vote for it on the Patreon…</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-11-09T17:30:42.850Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
