      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2025-12-29T20:11:23.229Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Short of il Alimento, this might be the closest they ever came to actually recording one of their other podcasts.  Also I’m surprised they haven’t actually started another podcast during this interim.</p>\n<p>Akash’Bhuta has a very rational fear, which is that she’ll go into hibernation for thousands of years and when she wakes up, a bunch of apes will have built cities all over her.  She’s basically a germophobe, and we’re the germs.</p>",
